    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for generating candidate child thoughts from a parent node. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Callers inject an implementation backed by an LLM to produce <computeroutput>k</computeroutput> diverse next reasoning steps from the accumulated thought path. </para>
